<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείρων</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖραρ,
			πέρας</span>) 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπειρος</span> (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boundless, endless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀπείρονα γαῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.98
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				187
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλήσποντος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.545
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος ἀ.</span> a
			<i>countless</i> people, ib.<i><span class="en">
				776
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνος ἀ.</span>
			<i>seeming endless,</i> i.e. <i>profound</i> sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.286
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείρονα γῆς βάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀλιθίων ἀ. γενέθλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					5.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.64
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span> a <i>vast</i>
			concourse, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				8.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπειρος</span>
			 (B) <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>, <i>without end</i> or <i>escape,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμοὶ ἀπείρονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.340
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> In 
				Att.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπειρος</span>
			 (B) <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i>having no end, circular,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλιος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					250
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.709.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11(2).161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				81
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν
				λόχῳ ἀπείρονι,</span> of persons standing in <i>a
				circle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				379
			</span></i>.</div>
